              "register": "neutral",
              "hanzi": "你有几个朋友？",
              "pinyin": "nǐ yǒu jǐ gè péngyou?",
              "english": "How many friends do you have?",
              "teaching_note": "几 asks “how many” for a relatively small count and is followed by a classifier."
            },
            {
              "id": "ex-085-2",
              "style": "written",
              "register": "neutral_written",
              "hanzi": "今天来了几个学生？",
              "pinyin": "jīntiān lái le jǐ gè xuéshēng?",
              "english": "How many students came today?",
              "teaching_note": ""
            }
          ],
          "learning_role": "introduced",
          "syllabus_refs": [
            {
              "curriculum_id": "hsk3-2025",
              "entry_id": 85
            }
          ],
          "pos_note": "Interrogative quantity pronoun/numeral meaning how many (几个人、几本书). 个 or 本 is the classifier; 几 is NOT a classifier.",
